  "course_summary": "ISEN 630 | Human Operator in Complex Systems | Summer 2026\nInstructor: Thomas Ferris | tferris@tamu.edu\nGrading: Assignments [40%], Exams [50%], Semester project report [10%] — A: 90-100%, B: 80-89%, C: 70-79%, D: 60-69%, F: 59% and lower\nTopics: NIOSH lifting equation, Reason's model of human error, Lambert's Law, MIL-STD-1472G section 5.2, MIL-STD-1472G section 5.4, MIL-STD-147",
